    "about": {
  "description": "Hi! ❤️ I'm an artist based in Tasmania 🌿, where forests, wildlife, and wide open skies provide endless inspiration. My work is rooted in fantasy, folklore, nature, and the small details that make a world feel alive.\n\nI enjoy creating illustrations filled with curiosity, whimsy, and wonder ✨, though I'm equally happy to explore darker, stranger, or more mysterious themes 🌙 when a project calls for them.\n\nI'm particularly drawn to muted colour palettes, old fairy-tale books 📖, and artwork that feels weathered by time. I love decorative details, wandering vines 🌿, curious creatures 🐭, and the hidden discoveries tucked away in illuminated manuscripts and forgotten folktales."},
